<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">- Kuturikihwa kwoBhaibhiri muchiKorekore</book>
  <para style="h">Zvidozuruhwa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Zvidozuruhwa kuna Johwani</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zvidozuruhwa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Zvid</para>
  <para style="mt1">ZVIDOZURUHWA Kuna</para>
  <para style="mt3">Johwani</para>
  <para style="imt">Kuwidzira</para>
  <para style="ip">Bhuku raZvidozuruhwa ndiro bhuku rokupedzisira muChibvumirano Chitsva. Ndiro ridopedzisihwa kunyohwa noNhumwa Johwani kuri kumakore yokumakumi mapfemba nomashano mumasure mokuzvahwa kwaKhirisitu, (Zvidozuruhwa 1:1). Adonyorawo bhuku rinoitiwa Vhangeri ridonyohwa naJohwani nomatsamba yamwe matatu yanoti, tsamba rokuthanga raJohwani, rochipiri raJohwani, norochitatu raJohwani. Johwani anozikana seuye “waidiwa naJesu” (Johwani 13:23). Adonyora bhuku raZvidozuruhwa paanga ari pachitsuwa chinoitiwa Patimosi ndava wanga wadzingihwa kwakareko nondava yokuparidza nhau dzidonaka pamusoro paJesu Khirisitu (Zvidozuruhwa 1:9).</para>
  <para style="ip">Chinangwa chaJohwani pakunyora bhuku raZvidozuruhwa nyhokukurudzira vaverengi kuti varambe vadotendeka kuna Jesu Khirisitu nokuvapasa tariro yokuti nguwa yokudzoka kwaJesu yava papfupi (Zvidozuruhwa 1:3, 22:7). Adonyorera maKhirisitu vese kunyanya makherekhe manomwe yari muzvitsauko (Zvidozuruhwa 2:1—3:1-22). Johwani anotsanangura chinyohwa chache sechiporofiti, (Zvidozuruhwa 1:3) uye anoshandisa mifananidzo idowanda mubhuku rese kutsanangura zvinhu zvaadoona. Bhuku ridofanana nozvimwe zvikamu zvoChibvumirano Chokare, kunyanya Zakariya (Zakariya 6:1-8). Tsuri dzinomwe nondiro dzinomwe zvidofananawo nomatambudziko yadotumihwa naMwari kuranga Ijipiti (Ekisodho 7:1—9:1-35). Zvidozuruhwa inonyaira zvonguwa yokupedzisira, kuti Jesu achakunda, uye vese vanovimba naye vachararama naye nokusingapere. Bhuku rakareri mbarikuchenjedze nokukupasa tariro yokuti Jesu ari kudzoka nokamangu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Marongehwo</para>
  <para style="io1">Johwani anothanga nokutaura kuti iye mbani uye kuti adotambira tini chiono chochiporofiti chakarechi (Zvidozuruhwa 1:1-20)</para>
  <para style="io1">Anopasa shoko rinobva kuna Jesu chaiko richienda kumakherekhe manomwe (Zvidozuruhwa 1:1—3:22)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ipopo anotsanangura zvisimbiso zvinomwe (Zvidozuruhwa 4:1—8:5) notsuri dzinomwe (Zvidozuruhwa 8:6—11:19)</para>
  <para style="io1">Musure mozvakarezvi Johwani anotsanangura hondo yoMwanakomana notsato inomisoro minomwe (Zvidozuruhwa 12:1—14:20)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ipopo anodzotsanangura nozvondiro dzinomwe dzoukari (Zvidozuruhwa 15:1—16:18)</para>
  <para style="io1">Chinotevera Johwani anotsanangura makundiro yanoita Mwari vavengi vache vari kudenga (Zvidozuruhwa 17:1—20:15)</para>
  <para style="io1">Pakupedzisira anotsanangura denga ritsva nonyika itsva zvichauya pamagumo (Zvidozuruhwa 21:1—22:21)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1" />Zvidozuruhwa zvaJesu Khirisitu, zvaadopasiwa naMwari kuti anangidze varanda vache zvinofanira kuitika nokamangu. Adozvizivisa nokutuma ngirozi yache kumuranda wache Johwani, <verse eid="REV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2" />anova ndiye adopfakazira shoko raMwari noupfakazi hwaJesu Khirisitu, nozvese zvaadoona. <verse eid="REV 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3" />Adokomborehwa uyo anoverenga mashoko yochiporofiti chakarechi, noanonzva achichengeta zvidonyohwa makaremo, nokuti nguwa yaapapfupi.<verse eid="REV 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumoresa Kherekhe dziNomwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4" />Johwani, kukherekhe dzinomwe dziri muEzhiya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:4">Mutsa norunyararo mbazvive kwamuri, kubva kuna iye aripo, wanga aripo, noachadzovapo, nokumweya minomwe iri pamberi pomupando wache woushe, <verse eid="REV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5" />uye kubva kuna Jesu Khirisitu, pfakazi idotendeka, dangwe kubva kuvadopfa, mutongi womadzimambo yonyika.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:5">Kuna iye anotida adotisunungura kubva muzvitema zvedu nogazi rache <verse eid="REV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6" />adotiita voumambo, novaphirisita kuna Mwari naBaba vache, kwaari mbakuve nokubhwinya nomasimba nokusingaperepere. Ameni.<verse eid="REV 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7" />Nangarai, anouya nomakuti. Meso yese yachamuona, pabodzi naivo vadomubaya. Marudzi yese yonyika yacharira nokuda kwache. Ndimwomwo. Ameni!<verse eid="REV 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8" />“Ndini Arufa naOmega,” ndizvo zvinonyaira Ishe Mwari, aripo, wanga aripo, noachadzovapo Womasimba yese.<verse eid="REV 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kunangidziwa kwaKhirisitu kuna Johwani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9" />Inipano Johwani, hama yenyu muna Jesu mukovani pabodzi naimipa pakutambudzika nomuumambo nomukutsungirira, ndanga ndiri pachitsuwa chinoitiwa Patimosi nokuda kwoshoko raMwari uye noupfakazi hwaJesu. <verse eid="REV 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10" />Ndanga ndiri muMweya pazuva raIshe, ndidonzva dzinga rikuru kumasure kwangu rinenge rotsuri, <verse eid="REV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11" />richiti, “Zvaunoona nyora mubhuku wozvitumira kumakherekhe manomwe, kuEfeso, nokuSimina, kuPegamo nokuThiyatira, kuSadhisi nokuFiradhefiya nokuRaodhesiya.”<verse eid="REV 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12" />Pakarepo ndidochungunuka kuti ndione wainyaira nainipano. Pandidochungunuka ndidoona zvigadziko zvomwenje zvondarama zvinomwe, <verse eid="REV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13" />uye pakati pozvigadziko zvomwenje ndidoona umwe adofanana nomwanakomana womunhu, adosimira jasi rirefu adozvisunga pachipfuwa chache nobhande rondarama. <verse eid="REV 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14" />Vhudzi romusoro wache ranga ridochena kunge donje, kuchena kunge matarara, meso yache yanga yadoita kunge murazvo womoto, <verse eid="REV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15" />tsoka dzache dzanga dzidofanana nomhangura inoyetima kunge yanatsiwa muvira romoto, uye dzinga rache ranga richiunga kunge mvura izinji, <verse eid="REV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16" />wanga adobata nyenyedzi dzinomwe mujanja rache roruji. Mumuromo mache mudobirika bakatwa ridopinza rinocheka kwese kwese, chiso chache changa chidoita kunge zuva rinopenya nosimba rarene rese. <verse eid="REV 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17" />Pandidomuona ndidowira pasi potsoka dzache kunge ndapfa. Asi iye adoisa ruoko rache roruji pamusoro pangu, ndokuti, “Reka kucha! Ndini wokuthanga nowokupedzisira, <verse eid="REV 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18" />ndini iye mupenyu, ndanga ndidopfa, ona ndiri mupenyu nokusingaperepere, ndino khiyi dzoIpfa nodzoNzvimbo yovadopfa. <verse eid="REV 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19" />Naizvozvo nyora zvawaona, zviripo nozvichadzovapo mumasure mozvakarezvi. <verse eid="REV 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20" />Pamusoro pozvidosvisvika zvonyenyedzi dzinomwe dzawaona mujanja rangu roruji nozvigadziko zvomwenje zvinomwe zvondarama nzvizvi, nyenyedzi dzinomwe ndidzo ngirozi dzokherekhe dzinomwe, nozvigadziko zvomwenje zvinomwe ndidzo kherekhe dzinomwe.<verse eid="REV 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2" />
  <para style="s">Tsamba kuKherekhe yopaEfeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1" />“Nyorera ngirozi yokherekhe iri paEfeso.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:1">‘Mazvi yaiye adobata nyenyedzi dzinomwe mujanja rache roruji anotekaira pakati pozvigadziko zvomwenje zvinomwe zvondarama. <verse eid="REV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2" />Ndinoziva mabasa yako, kushanda kwako nosimba, nokutsungirira kwako. Ndinoziva kuti unodaba kuonana novanhu vadoipa, udoongorora vanozvitenza kuti nhumwa asi vasiri ivo chaivo, udovawana vari vomabhwodo. <verse eid="REV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3" />Ndinoziva kuti uri kutsungirira nokuva nomwoyo murefu nokuda kwozita rangu, futi haunai kuneta. <verse eid="REV 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4" />Asi handifariri chinhu ichi kwauri, kuti udosiya rudo rawanga unaro pakuthanga. <verse eid="REV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5" />Naizvozvo chiyeuka paudowa, upinduke, uite mabasa yawaimboita pakuthanga. Kana ukareka kuita zvakarezvo ndichauya kwauri ndobisa chigadziko chako chomwenje panzvimbo yachene, kusara kwokunge wapinduka. <verse eid="REV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6" />Asi unochinhu ichi chidonaka, chokuti unozonda mabasa yovaNikoraiti, yandinozondawo inipano.’<verse eid="REV 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7" />“Uyo anonzeve, mbaanzve zvinonyaihwa noMweya kumakherekhe!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:7">“Anokunda ndichamubvumidza kuja zvomuti woupenyu uri muparadhaisi yaMwari.”<verse eid="REV 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsamba kukherekhe yopaSimina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8" />“Nyorera ngirozi yokherekhe iri paSimina.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:8">Mazvi yowokuthanga nowokupedzisira, adopfa ndokudzorarama pakamu. <verse eid="REV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9" />Ndinoziva kutambudzika kwako, nourombo hwako asi udopfuma! Nokunyomba kwovanozviti maJudha ivo vasiri, asi vari gungano raSathani! <verse eid="REV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10" />Reka kucha zvauchatambudziwa nazvo, nangara jabhurosi waakuda kuisa vamwe venyu mutorongo, kuti muyedzewe, futi muchatambudziwa kwomazuva gumi. Uve udotendeka kusvikira pakupfa, futi ndinodzokupasa korona youpenyu.”<verse eid="REV 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11" />“Uyo anonzeve, mbaanzve zvinoreva Mweya kumakherekhe!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:11">“Anokunda anokuwadziwaba noipfa yochipiri peno.”<verse eid="REV 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsamba kuKherekhe yopaPegamo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12" />“Nyorera ngirozi yokherekhe iri paPegamo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:12">Mazvi yaiye anobakatwa ridopinza rinocheka kwesekwese. <verse eid="REV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13" />Ndinoziva paunogara, kuti ndipo panomupando woushe hwaSathani. Udobatitsitsa zita rangu, futi haunai kuramba kutenda kwako mandiri, kunyange pamazuva yaAndipasi pfakazi yangu idotendeka, munhu wangu adobaiwa pakati penyu ipo panogara Sathani. <verse eid="REV 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14" />Asi ndinozvinhu zvishoma zvandisingafarire kwauri, unovamwe vadobatitsitsa dzidziso yaBharamu, adodzidzisa Bharaki kuisa mugwetso pamberi povana vaIzirairi kuti vaje zvidobaihwa zvifananidzo nokuita upombwe. <verse eid="REV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15" />Nokudaro unovamwe kamu vadobatitsitsa dzidziso yovaNikoraiti. <verse eid="REV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16" />Naizvozvo pinduka. Kana ukareka, ndichauya kamangu kwauri ndohwisana navo nobakatwa romuromo wangu.”<verse eid="REV 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17" />“Anonzeve mbaanzve, zvinoreva Mweya kumakherekhe!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:17">“Uyo anokunda ndichamupasa imwe mana idosvisviwa. Futi ndichamupasa ribwe richena rinozita ritsva ridonyohwa pariri risingazikane noumwe munhu kusiya kwoanoritambirayo basi.”<verse eid="REV 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsamba kuKherekhe yopaTiyatira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18" />“Nyorera ngirozi yokherekhe iri paTiyatira.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:18">‘Mazvi yoMwanakomana waMwari, anomaziso yadofanana nomurazvo womoto, notsoka dzidoita kunge ndarira inopenya. <verse eid="REV 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19" />Ndinoziva mabasa yako, rudo rako, nokutenda kwako, kushumira kwako, nokutsungirira kwako. Futi kuti mabasa yako yokupedzisira yadonyanya kukunda yokuthanga. <verse eid="REV 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20" />Asi ndinochinhu chandisingafare nacho kwauri, kuti unobvumira mukadzi anoitiwa Jezebheri, anozviti muporofitikadzi. Ari kudzidzisa nokutsautsa varanda vangu kuti vaite upombwe nokuja zvidobaihwa zvifananidzo. <verse eid="REV 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21" />Ndidomupasa nguwa kuti apinduke, asi adoramba kupinduka pauhure hwache. <verse eid="REV 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22" />Nangara, ndichamukhandira pabonde rouhwere, novese vaanohura navo ndichavakhanda pamatambudziko makuru, kana asinai kupinduka pamabasa yache. <verse eid="REV 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23" />Vana vache ndichavabaya vapfe. Uye kherekhe dzese dzichaziva kuti ndini ndinonzvera ndangariro nomwoyo, ndichapasa umwe noumwe wenyu zvinoenderana nomabasa yache.<verse eid="REV 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24" />“Asi kwamuri vamwe mese vacho vopaTiyatira, vasinai dzidziso yakarei, vasinai kudzidza zvinonzi novamwe nzvinhu zvidodzika zvaSathani, kwamuri ndinoti, handingakutakudzei umwe mutoro, <verse eid="REV 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25" />kunze kwokuti mundobatitsitsa zvamunazvo, kusvikira ndichiuya. <verse eid="REV 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26" />Anokundayo, achiramba achiita mabasa yangu kusvikira pakupedzisira, ndichamupasa masimba pamusoro pomarudzi, <verse eid="REV 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27" />achayatonga notsvimbo yodare, fanike hari dzomuumbi dzinopwanyiwa, <verse eid="REV 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28" />sezvandidopasiwa simba kubva kuna Baba vangu, ndichamupasawo nyenyedzi yomangwanani.”<verse eid="REV 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29" />“Anonzeve, mbaanzve zvinoreva Mweya kumakherekhe!”<verse eid="REV 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3" />
  <para style="s">Tsamba kuKherekhe yopaSadhisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1" />“Nyorera ngirozi yokherekhe iri paSadhisi, mazvi yaiye anomweya minomwe yaMwari nonyenyedzi dzinomwe. Ndinoziva mabasa yako, kuti unozita rokuti uri mupenyu, asi udopfa. <verse eid="REV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2" />Muka, usimbise zvasara zvaakuda kupfa, nokuti handinai kuwana mabasa yako yadokwana pamberi paMwari wangu. <verse eid="REV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3" />Yeuka, zvaudotambira nozvaudonzva, uzvichengete, uye upinduke. Kana usingapepuke, ndichauya sembavha, futi haungazive nguwa yandichauya nayo kwauri. <verse eid="REV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4" />Asi unovanhu vashomanana paSadhisi, yovanhu vasinai kusvipisa hembe dzavo, vachatekaira nainini vanohembe dzichena, nokuti vadofanihwa nazvo. <verse eid="REV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5" />Anokunda achasimidziwa hembe dzichena kunge ivo, uye ndinodzimwaba zita rache mubhuku roupenyu. Ndichapfakaza zita rache pamberi paBaba vangu nopamberi pongirozi dzavo.”<verse eid="REV 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6" />“Anonzeve, mbaanzve zvinoreva Mweya kumakherekhe!”<verse eid="REV 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shoko kuKherekhe yopaFiradhefiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7" />“Nyorera ngirozi yokherekhe iri paFiradhefiya. ‘Aya ndiyo mazvi yaiye mutsvene wochokwadi. Iye anokhiyi yaDhavhiti, anovhura pasinai anodzovhara, noanovhara pasinai anodzovhura. <verse eid="REV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8" />Ndinoziva mabasa yako. Nangara ndaisa pamberi pako musuwo udovhurika, usinai anokona kuuvhara. Ndinoziva kuti unosimba rishoma, asi udoteerera shoko rangu uye haunai kuramba zita rangu. <verse eid="REV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9" />Tetekera, avo vogungano raSathani, vanozviti maJudha ivo vasiri asi mbokunyepedzera, ndichavaita kuti vauye vakotame pamberi pako. Kuti vazive kuti ndidokuda. <verse eid="REV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10" />Nokuti udochengeta mashoko yangu uchitsungirira, ndichakuchengetawo peno panguwa yokuyedzewa iri kuuya panyika yese, kudzoedza vanogara panyika. <verse eid="REV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11" />Ndiri kuuya nokamangu. Batitsitsa zvaunazvo, kuti ureke kutorehwa korona yako. <verse eid="REV 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12" />Anokunda, ndichamuita mbiru muimba yaMwari wangu, anodzobirikaba makaremo. Ndichanyora paari zita raMwari wangu nozita roguta raMwari wangu, Jerusarema ritsva, rinoburuka richibva kudenga kuna Mwari wangu ndichanyorawo kamu paari zita rangu ritsva.'<verse eid="REV 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13" />“Anonzeve, mbaanzve zvinoreva Mweya kumakherekhe!”<verse eid="REV 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shoko kuKherekhe yopaRaodhesiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14" />“Nyorera ngirozi yokherekhe iri paRaodhesiya. ‘Mazvi yaAmeni, pfakazi idotendeka noyochokwadi, Muwaniwa kuzvisikwa zvaMwari. <verse eid="REV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15" />Ndinoziva mabasa yako, kuti hautonhori kana kupisa. Ndaida kuti hasa waitotonhora kana kupisa! <verse eid="REV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16" />Zvino zvaunondothuma usingatonhore kana kupisa, ndichakusvipura mukamwa mangu. <verse eid="REV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17" />Nokuti unozviti, ‘Ndidopfuma, ndidopfumisiwa, futi hapanai chandinosaya.’ Usingazive kuti ndiwe unourombo hudokungudza uri womangamanga, unosiririsa, uri murombo, rombe, futi uri pedzi peno. <verse eid="REV 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18" />Naizvozvo ndinokupasa zano rokuti utenge kwandiri ndarama idonatsiwa nomoto, kuti upfume, uve nohembe dzichena kuti uzvisimidze ubise nyadzi dzokuva pedzi, kuti ufukidze nyadzi dzoupedzi hwako hureke kuonewa, ndokupasa chizoro chomeso, kuti uwone. <verse eid="REV 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19" />Vese vandinoda ndinovaranga nokuvarova, naizvozvo shingaira upinduke. <verse eid="REV 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20" />Ona, ndinomira pamusuwo ndichigugudza, kana munhu akanzva dzinga rangu akavhura musuwo, ndichapinda maari ndoja pabodzi naye, iye nainini. <verse eid="REV 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21" />Anokunda ndichamupasa mvumo yokugara pamupando wangu woushe, fanike inini ndidokunda ndokugara pabodzi naBaba vangu pamupando wavo woushe.”<verse eid="REV 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22" />“Anonzeve, mbaanzve zvinoreva Mweya kumakherekhe!”<verse eid="REV 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4" />
  <para style="s">Ushumiri Hwokudenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1" />Mumasure mozvakarezvi ndidonangara, ndokuona musuwo udovhurika kudenga!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:1">Dzinga rokuthanga randidonzva richinyaira nainini rinenge rotsuri, ridoti, “Kwira pano ndikunangidze zvinofanira kuitiwa mumasure mozvakarezvi.” <verse eid="REV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2" />Nokamangu ndidova muMweya, ndokuona mupando woushe udogadziwa kudenga, noumwe wanga adogarikika pamupandopo! <verse eid="REV 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3" />Iye wanga adogarikika ipopo wanga adofanana noribhwe rinokosha rojasipi norokaneriyoni panga pano utati hudofanana noribhwe roemarodhi hwanga hudopoteredza mupando woushe. <verse eid="REV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4" />Mupando woushe wanga udopoteredzewa nomipando youshe yaiva makumi mairi nominai, uye pamipando youshe yakareyo panga padogarikika vakuru, makumi mairi novanai, vadosimira zvichena, vanokorona dzondarama pamisoro yavo.<verse eid="REV 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5" />Nopamupando woushe panga pachivaima mheni, nomazvi nomaungira yokudhirima, futi pamberi pomupando woushe panga pachipfuta mwenje minomwe, inova mweya minomwe yaMwari, <verse eid="REV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6" />futi pamberi pomupando woushe padooneka chinenge gungwa rogirazi, chiri ngwiro kungwerevera.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:6">Papfupi nomupando woushe nopadopoteredza mupando woushe kumativi yese panga panozvisikwa zvipenyu zvinai zvidozara nomeso kumberi nokumasure. <verse eid="REV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7" />Chisikwa chipenyu chokuthanga changa chidofanana nomhondoro, chisikwa chipenyu chochipiri changa chidofanana nodhonza, chisikwa chipenyu chochitatu changa chino chiso chinenge chomunhu, chisikwa chipenyu chochinai changa chidofanana nogondo rinourukha. <verse eid="REV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8" />Pazvisikwa zvipenyu zvinai, chimwe nochimwe changa chinomaphaphiro matanhatu, zvanga zvidozara nomeso kumativi yese nopasi pomaphaphiro. Hazvifemi kuimba masikati nousiku zvichiti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:8">“Mutsvene, mutsvene, mutsvene, ndiye Ishe Mwari Womasimba yese,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:8">wanga aripo, aripo, noachadzouya.”<verse eid="REV 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9" />Zvisikwa zvipenyu pese pazvinovikhira kubhwinya nokukudziwa nokutenda kuno wakareyo anogara pamupando woushe, iye anorarama nokusingapere, <verse eid="REV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10" />vakuru vanomakumi mairi novanai vanohwarara pamberi pouyo anogara pamupando woushe vachimunamata iye anorarama nokusingapere, vachibiritsa korona dzavo vachidziisa pamberi pomupando woushe vachiimba vachiti,<verse eid="REV 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11" />“Imimi Ishe Mwari wedu mudofanira</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">kuti muvikhihwe kubhwinya nokukudziwa nomasimba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">Nokuti ndimi mudosika zvinhu zvese,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">nokuda kwenyu zvidosikiwa uye zvidovapo.”<verse eid="REV 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5" />
  <para style="s">Bhuku noHwayana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1" />Zvino ndidoona mujanja roruji raiye wanga adogarikika pamupando woushe, muno bhuku ridonyohwa kwese, mukati nokunze, ranga ridonamiwa nozvisimbiso zvinomwe. <verse eid="REV 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2" />Pakarepo ndidoona ngirozi inosimba ichidaidzira nodzinga rinoruzha ichiti, “Mbaniko adokodzera kunamanura zvisimbiso zvobhuku rakareri nokurivhura?” <verse eid="REV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3" />Asi hapanai munhu kudenga kana panyika kana pasi ponyika adokona kunamanura zvisimbiso zvobhuku, kurivhura kana kunangara mukati marene. <verse eid="REV 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4" />Pakarepo ndidoriritsa ndava hakunai kuwanika munhu adofanira kuti anamanure bhuku kana kunangara mukati marene. <verse eid="REV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5" />Zvino umwe wovakuru adoti kwandiri, “Reka kurira, nangara, Mhondoro yorudzi raJudha, Mudzi waDhavhiti adokunda kuti avhure zvisimbiso zvobhuku zvinomwe.”<verse eid="REV 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6" />Zvino pakati pomupando woushe nozvisikwa zvipenyu zvinai novakuru, ndidoona Hwayana ridomira pakarepo, ridoita kunge ridobaiwa, rinomanyanga manomwe nomeso manomwe, inova mweya minomwe yaMwari idotumiwa panyika yese. <verse eid="REV 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7" />Adoenda kotora bhuku kubva mujanja roruji raiyeuye wanga adogarikika pamupando woushe. <verse eid="REV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8" />Paadotora bhuku, zvisikwa zvipenyu zvinai novakuru makumi mairi novanai vadohwarara pamberi poHwayana, umwe noumwe wanga adobata kamukubwe nombiya dzondarama dzidozara zvinonushira, iri minamato yovatsvene. <verse eid="REV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9" />Vadoimba chimbo chitsva vachiti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">“Ndimi mudofanira kutora bhuku</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">nokuvhura zvisimbiso zvarene.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">Nokuti mudobaiwa, nogazi renyu mudotengera Mwari</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">vanhu vanobva kumarudzi yese nomitauro yese novanhu nonyika.<verse eid="REV 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10" />Mudovaita kuti vave vanhu voumambo novaphirisita kuti vashumire Mwari wedu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:10">uye vachatonga pasi pese.”<verse eid="REV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11" />Pakarepo ndidonangara, ndokubva ndanzva dzinga rongirozi dzidowanda dzanga dzidopoteredza mupando woushe nozvisikwa zvipenyu novakuru, kuwanda kwadzene kwanga kuri zviuru zvozviuru, nozviuru gumi zvidopetewa gumi rozviuru, <verse eid="REV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12" />dzidoimba nodzinga rinoruzha dzichiti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">“Hwayana ridobaiwa ridofanira</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">kutambira simba, noupfumi, nouchenjeri, noukuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">nokukudziwa, nokubhwinya, nokurumbidziwa!”<verse eid="REV 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13" />Zvino ndidonzva zvisikwa zvipenyu zvese zviri kudenga nozviri panyika nozviri pasi ponyika nozviri mugungwa, nozvese zviri mukati mazvene, zvichiti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">“Kuna iye adogarikika pamupando woushe nokuHwayana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:13">mbakuve nokuropafadziwa, nokukudziwa nokubhwinya, nosimba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:13">nokusingaperepere!”<verse eid="REV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14" />Ipopo zvisikwa zvipenyu zvinai zvidoti, “Ameni!” Vakuru vadohwarara vachibva vanamata.<verse eid="REV 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6" />
  <para style="s">Zvisimbiso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1" />Zvino ndidoona Hwayana paridovhura chimwe chozvisimbiso zvinomwe, ndokunzva chimwe chozvisikwa zvipenyu zvinai chichinyaira nodzinga rinenge kudhirima chichiti, “Uya!” <verse eid="REV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2" />Ndidonangara, ndokuona bhiza richena nowanga adorigadha wanga anoutati, adopasiwa korona ndokubirika semukundi kuti akunde.<verse eid="REV 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3" />Hwayana paridovhura chisimbiso chochipiri, ndidonzva chisikwa chipenyu chochipiri chichiti, “Uya!” <verse eid="REV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4" />Pakarepo padobirika rimwe bhiza, ridotsvukuruka, wanga adorigadha adobvumidziwa kubiritsa runyararo panyika, uye kuti vanhu vabayane, futi adopasiwa bakatwa rikuru.<verse eid="REV 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5" />Hwayana paridovhura chisimbiso chochitatu, ndidonzva chisikwa chipenyu chochitatu chichiti, “Uya!” Ndidonangara, ndokuona, bhiza risvipa, wanga adorigadha wanga adobata mhimo mujanja rache, <verse eid="REV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6" />ipopo ndidonzva rinenge dzinga pakati pozvisikwa zvipenyu zvinai richiti, “Mhimo yogorosi padhinari, nozvipimo zvitatu zvobhari padhinari ribodzi, asi reka kukanganisa mapfuta nowaini!”<verse eid="REV 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7" />Hwayana paridovhura chisimbiso chochinai, ndidonzva dzinga rochisikwa chipenyu chochinai richiti, “Uya!” <verse eid="REV 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8" />Pandidonangara, ndidoona, bhiza ripfumbu, zita rowanga adorigadha raiitiwa Ipfa, uye Nzvimbo yovadopfa idomutevera iri papfupi, vadopasiwa simba pamusoro pochikamu chochinai chonyika, kuti vabaye nobakatwa, nonzara, nomatenda, nozvirombo zvonyika.<verse eid="REV 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9" />Hwayana paridovhura chisimbiso chochishano, ndidoona mweya yovanhu pasi poatari vanga vabaiwa nokuda kwoshoko raMwari nokwokuchengetedza kwavanga vaita upfakazi, <verse eid="REV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10" />vadokuwa nodzinga rinoruzha vachiti, “Nai Ishe Mutongi, mutsvene nowochokwadi, muchareka kutonga vanogara panyika nokutsiva gazi redu kusvikira riniko?” <verse eid="REV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11" />Pakarepo umwe noumwe wavo adopasiwa hembe ichena ndokunyepewa kuti vambofema kwokanguwa kapfupi, kusvikira uwandu hwakwana hwovarandabiyavo nohama dzavo vaifanira kubaiwa kunge ivo vabaiwawo.<verse eid="REV 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12" />“Ndidonangara ndikaona Hwayana paridovhura chisimbiso chochitanhatu, padoita kugwetedzedzeka kukuru kwonyika, zuva ridosvipa kunge kapfebve kadogadzihwa noukuse husvipa hwombudzi. Mwedzi wese udotsvuka kunge magazi, <verse eid="REV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13" />nonyenyedzi dzidombwera pasi kunge mukuyu uri kuzunza maganga yawene, kana uchigwetedzewa noduthu rinosimba. <verse eid="REV 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14" />Denga ridonyangarika kunge bhuku rinopupurutsiwa, nogomo rimwe norimwe nochitsuwa chimwe nochimwe chidobiritsiwa panzvimbo yazvene. <verse eid="REV 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15" />Pakarepo madzimambo yonyika, novakuru, novatungamiriri vohondo, novapfumi, novanosimba, nomunhu wese, muranda noadosununguka, vadohwanda mumapako nomumabhwe yomakomo. <verse eid="REV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16" />Vadodaidzira kumakomo nokumabhwe vachiti, “Tiwirei mutisvisve muchitibisa pameso yaiye adogarikika pamupando woushe nokubva paukari hwoHwayana, <verse eid="REV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17" />nokuti zuva rikuru roukari hwavo rasvika, mbani anokona kumira pariri?”<verse eid="REV 6:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7" />
  <para style="s">VaIzirairi Zviuru Zana noMakumi Manai noVanai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1" />Mumasure mozvakarezvi ndidoona ngirozi dzinai dzidomira pamativi manai yonyika, dzidovhara mhepo dzinai dzonyika, kuti mhepo ireke kuvhuvhuta panyika kana pagungwa kana pamuti upi zvawene. <verse eid="REV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2" />Ipopo ndidoona imwe ngirozi ichikwira ichibva kumabvazuva, yanga inochisimbiso chaMwari mupenyu, idodaidzira nodzinga rinoruzha kungirozi dzinai dzanga dzapasiwa masimba yokukuwadza nyika nogungwa, <verse eid="REV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3" />ichiti, “Rekai kukuwadza nyika kana gungwa kana miti, kusvikira taisa chisimbiso pahuma dzovaranda vaMwari.” <verse eid="REV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4" />Ndidonzva kuwanda kwovadoisiwa chisimbiso, vanga vari zviuru zvinomazana makumi manai nozvinai kubva kumarudzi yese yovana vaIzirairi, <verse eid="REV 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5" />kubva kurudzi raJudha zviuru gumi nozviiri vadoisiwa chisimbiso, zviuru gumi nozviiri kurudzi raRubheni, zviuru gumi nozviiri kurudzi raGadhi, <verse eid="REV 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6" />zviuru gumi nozviiri kurudzi raAseri, zviuru gumi nozviiri kurudzi raNafutari, zviuru gumi nozviiri kurudzi raManase, <verse eid="REV 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7" />zviuru gumi nozviiri kurudzi raSimiyoni, zviuru gumi nozviiri kurudzi raRevhi, zviuru gumi nozviiri kurudzi raIsaka, <verse eid="REV 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8" />zviuru gumi nozviiri kurudzi raZebhuroni, zviuru gumi nozviiri kurudzi raJosefa, zviuru gumi nozviiri vadoisiwa chisimbiso kurudzi raBhenjamini.<verse eid="REV 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gurusvusvu roVanhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9" />Mumasure mozvakarezvi ndidonangara ndokuona, gurusvusvu rikurufutiro risingaverengeke! Rinobva kunyika dzese, nokumarudzi yese, nokuvanhu vese, nomitauro yese, vadomira pamberi pomupando woushe nopamberi poHwayana. Vanga vadosimira zvipfeko zvichena vadobata michindwe mumanja yavo, <verse eid="REV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10" />vadodaidzira nodzinga rinoruzha vachiti, “Ruponiso ndaMwari wedu anogara pamupando woushe, nokuHwayana!” <verse eid="REV 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11" />Ipopo ngirozi dzese dzidomira dzidopoteredza mupando woushe novakuru nozvisikwa zvipenyu zvinai, vadohwarara pamberi pomupando woushe ndokunamata Mwari, <verse eid="REV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12" />vachiti, “Ameni! Kurumbidziwa, nokubhwinya, nouchenjeri, nokupasa kutenda, nokukudziwa, nosimba, noukuru mbazvive kuna Mwari wedu nokusingaperepere! Ameni.”<verse eid="REV 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13" />Pakarepo umwe wovakuru adoti kwandiri, “Mbanaani vakareva, vadosimira zvichena, uye vadobva poi?”<verse eid="REV 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14" />Ndidoti kwaari, “Changamire, ndimi munoziva.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 7:14">Adoti kwandiri, “Vakareva ndivo vadobva mukushupika kukuru, vadosuka majasi yavo mugazi roHwayana ndokuyachenesa. <verse eid="REV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15" />Naizvozvo vari pamberi pomupando woushe waMwari, vanomunamata masikati nousiku muimba yache Mwari, iye anogara pamupando woushe achavavhumbamira. <verse eid="REV 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16" />Havachakomoka nonzara, kana kupfa nonyota, zuva harichavapisa kana kupisiwa nokumwe kupisa, <verse eid="REV 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17" />nokuti Hwayana riri pakati pomupando woushe richava nyakabusa wavo, richavatungamirira kutusipiti tomvura ipenyu, Mwari achapisika misodzi yese pameso yavo.<verse eid="REV 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8" />
  <para style="s">Chisimbiso choChinomwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1" />Hwayana paridovhura chisimbiso chochinomwe, padova nokunyarara kudenga kwochikamu chinenge pakati nopakati poawa ibodzi. <verse eid="REV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2" />Pakarepo ndidoona ngirozi dzinomwe dzidomira pamberi paMwari, dzidopasiwa tsuri dzinomwe.<verse eid="REV 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3" />Zvino imwe ngirozi idouya ndokumira paatari inombiya yondarama yozvinonushira, idopasiwa zvinonushira zvidowanda kuti izviise pabodzi nominamato yovatsvene vese pamusoro poatari yondarama yanga iri pamberi pomupando woushe. <verse eid="REV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4" />Utsi hwozvinonushira pabodzi nominamato yovatsvene kubva pajanja rongirozi hudokwira pamberi paMwari. <verse eid="REV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5" />Ipopo ngirozi idotora mbiya iye ndokuizaza nomoto wopathafura yokupira zvipo ndokuukhandira panyika, pachibva pava nokudhirima nomadzinga, nokuvaima kwomheni nokugwetedzeka kwonyika.<verse eid="REV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsuri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6" />Zvino ngirozi dzinomwe dzanga dzinotsuri dzinomwe dzidogadzirira kuridza.<verse eid="REV 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7" />Ngirozi yokuthanga idoridza tsuri yayene, kukauya chimvuramabhwe nomoto, zvidokumanisiwa nogazi, ndokuzvikhandira panyika, ipopo chikamu chochitatu chonyika chidotsva chese, nochochitatu chomiti chidotsva, nousva hwese hunyoro hudotsva.<verse eid="REV 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8" />Ngirozi yochipiri idoridza tsuri yayene, chimwe chinhu chinenge gomo rikuru, rinopfuta moto, chidokhandihwa mugungwa, chikamu chochitatu chogungwa chidova gazi, <verse eid="REV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9" />chikamu chochitatu chozvisikwa zvipenyu zvanga zviri mugungwa chidopfa, nochikamu chochitatu chozvikepe chidoparadziwa.<verse eid="REV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10" />Ngirozi yochitatu idoridza tsuri yayene, nyenyedzi ikuru idombwera kubva kudenga, ichipfuta kunge chitsiga ndokuwira pamusoro pochikamu chochitatu chotuhwizi nopamusoro potusipiti tomvura. <verse eid="REV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11" />Zita ronyenyedzi yakareyo raiitiwa Chinovava, chikamu chochitatu chomvura chidovavisiwa, vanhu vazinjifuti vadopfa nomvura, nokuti yanga yavavisiwa.<verse eid="REV 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12" />Ngirozi yochinai idoridza tsuri yayene, chikamu chochitatu chozuva chidoora, nochikamu chochitatu chomwedzi nochikamu chochitatu chonyenyedzi, kuti zvikamu zvochitatu zvochiedza chazvene chisvipe, uye kuti chikamu chochitatu chomasikati chireke kuvheneka, zvibodzibodzizvo nochikamu chochitatu chousiku.<verse eid="REV 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13" />Zvino ndidonangara, ndokunzva gondo richirira nodzinga rinoruzha paranga richiurukha pakati podenga richiti, “Nhamu, nhamu, nhamu kuno vanogara panyika, nondava yoyamwe madzinga yotsuri dzaakuda kuridziwa nodzimwe ngirozi dzitatu!”<verse eid="REV 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1" />Zvino ngirozi yochishano paidoridza tsuri yayene, ndidoona nyenyedzi idombwerera panyika ichibva kudenga, uye idopasiwa khiyi yomusuwo wogomba risingagon'e. <verse eid="REV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2" />Idovhura musuwo wogomba risingagon'e, utsi hudobirika mugombamo hunenge utsi hwobimbimbi romoto rikuru, zuva nomudenga zvidosvipisiwa noutsi hudobva pamusuwo wogomba. <verse eid="REV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3" />Pakarepo muutsimo mudobirika mabombo yadobva yauya panyika, yadopasiwa simba ridofanana nosimba roturize topanyika. <verse eid="REV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4" />Yadoudziwa kuti yareke kukanganisa usva panyika kana chimwe chinhu chinyoro kana muti upi zvawene, asi vanhu chete vasinai chisimbiso chaMwari pahuma dzavo. <verse eid="REV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5" />Mabombo yadotendehwa kuvahwadzisa kwomwedzi mishano, asi aikona kuvabaya, kuhwadzisa kwayene kwanga kudofanana nokuhwadzisa kwokarize kana kapfonda munhu. <verse eid="REV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6" />Pamazuva yakareyo vanhu vachatsvaga ipfa asi havaiwane, vachaditsa kupfa, asi ipfa ichavatiza.<verse eid="REV 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7" />Pakuoneka kwayene mabombo yacho yanga yadofanana nomabhiza yanenge yagadzirihwa hondo, pamisoro yayene panga pano zvimwe zvinenge korona dzondarama, zviso zvayene zvanga zvidoita kunge zvovanhu. <verse eid="REV 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8" />Vhudzi rayene ranga ridoita kunge vhudzi rovanhukadzi, nomazino yayene yanga yadoita kunge mazino yomhondoro. <verse eid="REV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9" />Pazvipfuwa zvayene panga pano zvivharidziro zvidoita kunge matare nokutinhira kwomaphaphiro yayene kwanga kudoita kunge kutinhira kwongoro dzomabhiza mazinji yanotizira kuenda kuhondo. <verse eid="REV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10" />Yanga yanomwise inenge yoturize inopfonda, mwiseyo yaiva nosimba raikuwadza vanhu kwomwedzi mishano. <verse eid="REV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11" />Yaiva namambo wayene, anova ngirozi yogomba risingagon’e. Zita rache muchiHebheru rinoitiwa Abhadhoni, uye muchiGiriki inonzi Aporiyoni zvinoreva kuti muparadzi.<verse eid="REV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12" />Nhamu yokuthanga yadarika, nangara, dzimwe nhamu dziiri dzichatevera.<verse eid="REV 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13" />Pakarepo ngirozi yochitanhatu idoridza tsuri yayene, ndichibva ndanzva izvi richibva pamanyanga manai yothafura yochipiriso yondarama yanga iri pamberi paMwari, <verse eid="REV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14" />richiti kungirozi yochitanhatu yanga inotsuri, “Sugudura ngirozi dzinai dzidosungirihwa pahwizi rikuru rinoitiwa Yufuretisi.” <verse eid="REV 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15" />Nokudaro ngirozi dzinai dzidosuguduriwa, dzanga dzidogadzirihwa nguwa yacho, nozuva, nomwedzi, uye nogore, kuti dzibaye chochitatu chovanhu. <verse eid="REV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16" />Kuwanda kwomauto yanga yadogadha mabhiza yanga yari mamiriyoni mazana mairi, ndidonzva uwandu hwayene. <verse eid="REV 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17" />Aya ndiyo maonero yandidoita mabhiza mukunangidziwa kwangu, vanga vadoyagadha vanga vadosimira zvivharidziro zvozvipfuwa zvinoruvara ritsvuku kunge moto, norinenge denga risinai makuti, norokeri kunge sarufa. Misoro yomabhiza yanga idoita kunge yomhondoro, uye moto noutsi nosarufa zvidobirika mumiromo yayene. <verse eid="REV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18" />Nomatambudziko yakareya matatu chochitatu chovanhu chidobaiwa, nomoto noutsi nosarufa zvidobirika mumiromo yayene. <verse eid="REV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19" />Nokuti simba romabhiza riri mumiromo yayene nokumwise kwayene ndava mwise yayene idoita kunge nyoka, dzinomisoro yadzinokuwadza nayo.<verse eid="REV 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20" />Vamwe vanhu, vasinai kubaiwa nomatambudziko yakareya, havanai kupinduka kubva pamabasa yomanja yavo kana kureka kunamata mashave nozvifananidzo zvondarama nozvo sirivha nozvondarira nozvomabhwe nozvomiti, zvifananidzo zvisingaone kana kunzva kana kutekaira, <verse eid="REV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21" />havanai kupinduka kubva pakubaya kwavo, kana pamapipi yavo, kana paupombwe hwavo, kana paumbavha hwavo.<verse eid="REV 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10" />
  <para style="s">Ngirozi noBhuku riDiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1" />Zvino ndidoona imwe ngirozi inosimba ichiburuka kubva kudenga. Yanga idoputihwa noguti ino utati pamusoro payene, chiso chayene changa chidoita kunge zuva, uye tsoka dzayene dzanga dzidoita kunge mbiru dzomoto. <verse eid="REV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2" />Yanga idobata bhuku ridiki ridovhuriwa mujanja rayene. Idoisa tsoka yayene yoruji pagungwa notsoka yayene yomamose panyika. <verse eid="REV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3" />Idodaidzira noizvi rikuru, kunge mhondoro inodzvova, paidodaidzira, kudhirima kunomwe kudobiritsa mazvi yakwene. <verse eid="REV 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4" />Zvino kudhirima kunomwe pakudonyaira, ndanga ndaakutonyora, asi ndidonzva izvi richibva kudenga richiti, “Vhara zvanyaihwa nokudhirima kunomwe, reka kuzvinyora.”<verse eid="REV 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5" />Ipopo ngirozi yandanga ndaona idomira pagungwa nopanyika idosumudzira janja rayene roruji kudenga <verse eid="REV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6" />ndokupika naiye anorarama nokusingaperepere, adosika denga nozviri mukati marene, nonyika nozviri mukati mayene nogungwa nozviri mukati marene, kuti “Hapachinai nguwa, <verse eid="REV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7" />asi kuti mumazuva yotsuri yongirozi yochinomwe, zvidosvisvika zvaMwari zvaadonyaira kuvaranda vache novaporofiti zvichazazisiwa.”<verse eid="REV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8" />Pakarepo izvi rakareriye randidonzva richibva kudenga ridonyaira kwandiri pakamu, richiti, “Enda kotora bhuku ridovhuriwa riri mujanja rongirozi idomira pamusoro pogungwa nopamusoro ponyika.”<verse eid="REV 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9" />Nokudaro ndidoenda kungirozi ndokuinyepa kuti indipase bhuku ridiki, iyo idoti kwandiri, “Tora urije, richatapira kunge uchi mukamwa mako, asi richakusvota mumimba mako.”<verse eid="REV 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10" />Ipopo ndidotora bhuku ridiki mujanja rongirozi ndikarija, ridotapira mukamwa mangu kunge uchi, asi pandidorija mumimba mangu mudosvota. <verse eid="REV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11" />Uye ndidoudziwa kuti, “Unofanira kuporofita pakamu pamusoro povanhu vazinji nomarudzi nomitauro nomadzimambo.”<verse eid="REV 10:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11" />
  <para style="s">Pfakazi Dziiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1" />Pakarepo ndidopasiwa kamuti kokueresa kanenge tsvimbo, ndokunyepewa zvichinzi, “Enda koyera imba yaMwari noatari nokuverenga vanonamata makaremo, <verse eid="REV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2" />asi reka kuyera chivanze choimba yaMwari, chisiye ndava chidopasiwa kuvanhu vasiri maJudha, kuti vatsike guta ritsvene kwomwedzi makumi manai nomiiri. <verse eid="REV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3" />Ndichapasa pfakazi dzangu dziiri simba rokuti vaporofite vadosimira masaga, kwomazuva chiuru nomazana mairi nomakumi matanhatu.”<verse eid="REV 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4" />Vakareva ndiyo miti yomiorivhi miiri nozvigadziko zvomwenje zviiri zvidomira pamberi paIshe wonyika. <verse eid="REV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5" />Kana kunomunhu anoda kuvakuwadza, moto uchabirika mukamwa mavo uchiparadza vanovazonda, kana kunomunhu anoda kuvakuwadza, ndomabaihwo yaachaitiwa. <verse eid="REV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6" />Vanomasimba yokuvhara denga kuti mvura ireke kuna pamazuva yokuporofita kwavo, vanomasimba pamusoro pomvura kuti vaisandure ichiva gazi, nokurova nyika nomatambudzo yese nonguwa yavanoda.<verse eid="REV 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7" />Kana vapedza kupfakaza kwavo, chirombo chinokwira chichibva kugomba risingagon'e chichavahwisa chichivakunda nokuvabaya, <verse eid="REV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8" />futi zvitunha zvavo zvicharadzikiwa munzira yoguta rikuru rinodaidziwa nozita rokushinjirira rokuti Sodhoma noIjipiti, padoroverehwa Ishe wavo. <verse eid="REV 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9" />Kwomazuva matatu nochidimbu chopakati nopakati vamwe vanhu vanobva kuvanhu vese, kumarudzi yese, nomitauro yese, nonyika dzese vachaona zvitunha zvopfakazi vorambidza kuti zvivikhiwe muguwa. <verse eid="REV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10" />Uye avo vanogara panyika vachafara pamusoro pavo vachipasana zvipo, nokuti vaporofiti vakareva vairi vadotambudza avo vanogara panyika. <verse eid="REV 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11" />Asi mazuva matatu nochidimbu yadoti yapera mweya woupenyu udobva kuna Mwari udopinda mavari, vadosumuka ndokumira notsoka dzavo, kucha kukuru kudowira vese vadovaona. <verse eid="REV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12" />Pakarepo vadonzva izvi rinoruzha ridobva kudenga richiti kwavari, “Kwirai kuno!” Vadokwira kudenga noguti vavengi vavo vachizviona. <verse eid="REV 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13" />Zvino nonguwa yakareyo padova nokugwetedzeka kukuru kwonyika, chikamu chochigumi choguta chidokoromokera pasi, vanhu zviuru zvinomwe vadobaiwa nokugwetedzeka kwakareko, uye vadopurumuka vadocha ndokurumbidza Mwari wokudenga.<verse eid="REV 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14" />Nhamu yochipiri yadarika, nangara, nhamu yochitatu inouya kamangu.<verse eid="REV 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsuri yoChinomwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15" />Zvino ngirozi yochinomwe idoridza tsuri yayene, padoita mazvi yoruzha kudenga yaiti, “Umambo hwonyika hwava umambo hwaIshe wedu naKhirisitu wache, achatonga nokusingaperepere.” <verse eid="REV 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16" />Pakarepo vakuru makumi mairi novanai vanogara pamipando yavo youshe pamberi paMwari vadohwarara vakanamata Mwari, <verse eid="REV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17" />vachiti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">“Tinokupasai kutenda imimi, Ishe Mwari Womasimba yese, muripo nomanga muripo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">Nokuti mudotora masimba yenyu makuru</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">mukathanga kutonga.<verse eid="REV 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18" />Nyika dzidogumbuka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">asi ukari hwenyu hudosvika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">nguwa yasvika yokuti vadopfa vatongewe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">uye kuti mupase mubairo varanda venyu, vaporofiti novatsvene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">novanocha zita renyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">vese vadiki novakuru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">uye kuti muparadze vaye vanoparadza nyika.”<verse eid="REV 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19" />Ipopo imba yaMwari idovhuriwa kudenga, phutumende yochibvumirano chache idooneka muimba yache. Kudobva kwava nokuvaima kwomheni, nomazvi, nokudhirima, nokugwetedzeka kwonyika, nochimvuramabhwe chikuru.<verse eid="REV 11:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12" />
  <para style="s">Mukadzi noTsato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1" />Chiratidzo chikuru chidooneka kudenga, mukadzi wanga adosimira zuva, mwedzi uri pasi potsoka dzache, uye mumusoro wache manga munokorona yonyenyedzi gumi nodziiri, <verse eid="REV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2" />wanga anomimba adodaidzira pakuda kuzvara kwache, achiyaura pakuzvara.<verse eid="REV 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3" />Ipopo chimwe chiratidzo chidooneka kudenga. Tsato ikuru itsvuku, inomisoro minomwe nomanyanga gumi, pamisoro yayene panga panokorona dzinomwe. <verse eid="REV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4" />Mwise wayene udotsvaira chochitatu chonyenyedzi dzokudenga, ikadzikutukudzira pasi. Tsatoyo idomira pamberi pomukadzi wanga waakuzvara mwana, kuti imedze mwana wache kana wazvariwa, <verse eid="REV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5" />adozvara mwana mukomana, uyo achatonga marudzi yese notsvimbo yosimbi, asi mwanakomana wache adopwitiwa achikwidziwa kunaMwari nokumupando wache woushe. <verse eid="REV 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6" />Mukadzi adotizira kusango kunzvimbo yaadogadzirihwa naMwari, kuti vamuchengete kwomazuva chiuru nomazana mairi nomakumi matanhatu.<verse eid="REV 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7" />Zvino hondo idomuka kudenga, Mikaeri nongirozi dzache vadohwisana notsato, uye tsato nongirozi dzayene dzidohwisawo dzichitsiidza, <verse eid="REV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8" />asi dzidokundiwa futi panga pasisina nzvimbo yadzene kudenga. <verse eid="REV 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9" />Tsato ikuru idokutukudzihwa pasi, iyo nyoka yokare, inoitiwa Jabhurosi naSathani, munyengedzi wopasi pese adokutukudzihwa pasi panyika, pabodzi nongirozi dzayene.<verse eid="REV 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10" />Ipopo ndidonzva izvi rinoruzha kudenga, richiti, “Zvino ruponiso nomasimba noushe hwaMwari wedu nomasimba yaKhirisitu wache yauya, ndava munenedzeri wohama dzedu anovanenera masikati nousiku pamberi paMwari wedu wakutukudzihwa pasi. <verse eid="REV 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11" />Ivo vadomukunda nogazi roHwayana uye noshoko rokupfakaza kwavo, ndava havanai kuda upenyu hwavo kusvikira paipfa. <verse eid="REV 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12" />Saka farai, imimi denga naimimi munogara kwakareko! Asi munonhamu imimi nyika nogungwa, nokuti jabhurosi wauya pasi kwamuri adokaripa maninge, nokuti anoziva kuti nguwa yache njipfupi!”<verse eid="REV 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13" />Tsato paidoona kuti yakutukudzihwa pasi panyika, idodzingidza mukadzi adozvara mwana mukomana. <verse eid="REV 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14" />Asi mukadzi adopasiwa maphaphiro mairi yogondo rikuru kuti ambururukire kusango, kunzvimbo yaadochengetehwa kwonguwa, nodzimwe nguwa nochidimbu chonguwa, kusingasvikiwe notsato. <verse eid="REV 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15" />Ipopo nyoka idorutsa mvura idoita kunge kahwizi kubva mukamwa mayene ichida kuyeredza mukadzi nomafashamu. <verse eid="REV 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16" />Asi nyika idobatsira mukadzi, nyika idoshamisa muromo wayene ndokumedza kahwizi kanga kabiritsiwa kachibva mukamwa motsato. <verse eid="REV 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17" />Pakarepo tsato idokaripira mukadzi, idoenda koita hondo novamwe vana vache, vaye vanochengeta murairo waMwari novanopfakazira Jesu. <verse eid="REV 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 12:18" />Tsato idomira pajecha rogungwa.<verse eid="REV 12:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13" />
  <para style="s">Zvirombo Zviiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1" />Zvino ndidoona chirombo chichikwira kubva mugungwa, changa chino misoro minomwe nomanyanga gumi, changa chinokorona gumi dzanga dziri pamusoro pomanyanga yachene nopamisoro yachene panga panozita rokushora Mwari. <verse eid="REV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2" />Uye chirombo chakarechi chandidoona changa chidofanana nombada, tsoka dzachene dzanga dzidoita kunge dzochisvitsi, muromo wachene wanga udoita kunge womhondoro. Tsato idopasa chirombo masimba yayene nomupando wayene woushe nochikuriri chikuru. <verse eid="REV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3" />Umwe musoro wachene wanga unochironda kunge udokuwadziwa kusvikira paipfa, asi chironda chidopora, nyika yese idoshamisiwa ichitevera chirombo. <verse eid="REV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4" />Vanhu vadonamata tsato, nokuti idopasa chirombo masimba makuru, vadonamata chirombo, vachiti, “Mbaniko adofanana nochirombo, uye mbani anokona kuhwisana nacho?”<verse eid="REV 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5" />Ipopo chirombo chidopasiwa muromo unotaura mashoko makuru yokushora Mwari, chidobvumidziwa kushandisa simba kuti chizviite komwedzi makumi manai nomiiri. <verse eid="REV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6" />Chidoshama muromo wachene kuti chishore Mwari, nokushora zita rache nonzvimbo yache yaanogara, novanogara kudengavo. <verse eid="REV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7" />Chidotendehwawo kuhwisana novatsvene nokuvakunda, chidopasiwawo masimba pamusoro pomarudzi yese, novanhu vese, nomitauro yese, nonyika dzese dzopasi. <verse eid="REV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8" />Futi vese vanogara panyika vachachinamata, nowese asinai kunyorewa zita rache mubhuku roupenyu roHwayana ridobaiwa kusati kwava nomavambo yonyika.<verse eid="REV 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9" />“Kana pano anonzeve, mbaanzve. <verse eid="REV 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10" />Kana munhu achipambiwa, achapambiwa, kana munhu achifanira kubaiwa nobakatwa achabaiwa nobakatwa. Pakarepa ndipo panokurudzira kutsungirira nokutenda kwovatsvene.”<verse eid="REV 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11" />Pakarepo ndidoona chimwe chirombo chichikwira chichibva panyika, changa chinomanyanga mairi yadofanana noyohwayana chidotaura kunge tsato. <verse eid="REV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12" />Chidoshandisa masimba yese yochirombo chokuthanga panzvimbo yachene, chinosukumidza nyika novanogara mairi kuti vanamate chirombo chokuthanga, ichochiye changa chinochironda chaikonzera ipfa asi chidodzopora. <verse eid="REV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13" />Chinoita zviratidzo zvikuru, zvokuti chinoburutsa moto kubva kudenga uchiuya panyika pamberi povanhu. <verse eid="REV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14" />Nozviratidzo zvachidotendehwa kuita pamberi pochirombo chinonyengera vanogara panyika, chichiti vaitire mufananidzo chirombo chokukuwadziwa nobakatwa chichidzorarama. <verse eid="REV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15" />Chirombo chochipiri chidotendehwa kupasa mufananidzo wochirombo chokuthanga mweya kuti mufananidzo wochirombo utaure, nokuraira kuti vese vasinganamate mufananidzo wochirombo vabaiwe. <verse eid="REV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16" />Chinosukumidza vese vadiki novakuru, vapfumi novarombo, vadosununguka novaranda, kuti vaisiwe chidzvanga pajanja roruji kana pahuma dzavo, <verse eid="REV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17" />zvokuti hapanai munhu anotenga kana kutengesa kusiya kwokunge adoisiwa chidzvanga, rinova zita rochirombo kana chiverengo chozita rachene.<verse eid="REV 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18" />Zvakarezvi zvinoda uchenjeri. Anonzvitsitsa mbaaverenge chiverengo chochirombo, nokuti chiverengo chochirombo nyhiverengo chomunhu. Chiverengo chacho nyhokuti mazana matanhatu nomakumi matanhatu notanhatu.<verse eid="REV 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14" />
  <para style="s">Hwayana noVanhu Varene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1" />Zvino ndidonangara, ndokuona pagomo roZiyoni Hwayana adomira, vanga vadomira naye vanga vari zviuru zana nomakumi manai novanai vanga vanozita rache nozita raBaba vache ridonyohwa pahuma dzavo. <verse eid="REV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2" />Pakarepo ndidonzva izvi richibva kudenga ranga ridoita kunge kuunga kwomvura izinji uye kunge kudhirima kukuru, izvi randidonzva ranga ridoita kunge romarimba yanenge yachiridziwa novanoridza. <verse eid="REV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3" />Vadoimba chimbo chitsva pamberi pomupando woushe nopamberi pozvisikwa zvipenyu zvinai nopamberi povakuru. Hapanai adokona kudzidza chimbo chakarecho kusiya kovakarevaye zviuru zana nomakumi manai novanai vanga vadzikinuriwa panyika. <verse eid="REV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4" />Vakareva ndivo vasinai kuzvisvipisa novakadzi, nokuti vadochena kunge mhandara, ndivo vanotevera Hwayana kwese kwarinoenda, ndivo vadodzikinuriwa pakati povanhu kuti vave zvibereko zvokuthanga zvaMwari noHwayana. <verse eid="REV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5" />Futi mumuromo mavo hamunai kuwanika mabhwodo, havanai chavanonenedzehwa.<verse eid="REV 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngirozi Dzitatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6" />Ipopo ndidoona imwe ngirozi ichiurukha mudenga, inovhangeri risingapere kuti iparidzire vanogara panyika, kunyika dzese, nokumarudzi yese, nomitauro, novanhu vese, <verse eid="REV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7" />idoti noizvi rinoruzha, “Ichai Mwari mumurumbidze iye, nokuti nguwa yache yokutonga yasvika. Uye munamatei adosika denga nonyika, nogungwa notusipiti twomvura.”<verse eid="REV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8" />Imwe ngirozi yochipiri idotevera, ichiti, “Rawa! Rawa Bhabhironi guta rikuru! Ridomwisa marudzi yese waini youhure hwarene!”<verse eid="REV 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9" />Ipopo imwe ngirozi yochitatu, idovatevera, ichiti noizvi rinoruzha, “Kana munhu akanamata chirombo nomufananidzo wachene, nokutambira chidzvanga chachene pahuma yache kana pajanja rache, <verse eid="REV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10" />naiyewo achamwa waini youkari hwaMwari, idodiriwa isinai kusanganisiwa nomvura mumukombe woukari hwache, achatambudziwa mumoto nosarufa pamberi pongirozi dzitsvene nopamberi poHwayana. <verse eid="REV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11" />Utsi hwokutambudzika kwavo hunokwira kumusoro nokusingaperepere, havanai zororo, masikati kana usiku, vakareva vanamati vochirombo nomufananidzo wachene, noupi zvache anotambira chidzvanga chachene.”<verse eid="REV 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12" />Ipopa ndipo panoda kutsungirira kwovatsvene, vanochengeta mirairo yaMwari nokugara vadotendeka kuna Jesu.<verse eid="REV 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13" />Pakarepo ndidonzva izvi ridobva kudenga richiti, “Nyora zvakarezvi uti: Vadokomborehwa vadopfa vanopfira muna Ishe kubva izvozvino.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 14:13">Mweya anonyaira kuti, “Vadokomborehwa zvochokwadi, kuti vazorore kubva pakushanda kwavo, nokuti mabasa yavo yanovatevera!”<verse eid="REV 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukohwewa kwoNyika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14" />Ipopo ndidonangara, ndokuona guti richena, nowanga adogara pamusoro parene wanga adofanana nomwanakomana womunhu, anokorona yondarama mumusoro wache, nojeko ridopinza mujanja rache. <verse eid="REV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15" />Zvino imwe ngirozi idobirika muimba yaMwari, ichidaidzira noizvi rinoruzha kunaiye wanga adogara pamusoro poguti ichiti, “Torai jeko renyu mukohwe, nokuti nguwa yokukohwa yasvika, nokuti gohwo ronyika raibva.” <verse eid="REV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16" />Pakarepo wanga adogarikika pamusoro poguti adocheka nojeko rache, nyika ndokubva yakohwewa.<verse eid="REV 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17" />Zvino imwe ngirozi idobirika muimba yaMwari kudenga, naiyowo yanga inojeko ridopinza.<verse eid="REV 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18" />Pakarepo imwe ngirozi idobirika paatari, yanga inomasimba pamusoro pomoto, idodaidzira noizvi rinoruzha, kunaiye wanga anojeko ridopinza ichiti, “Tora jeko rako ridopinza, uunganidze misumbu yomizambiringa yonyika, nokuti mazambiringa yayene yaibva.” <verse eid="REV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19" />Ipopo ngirozi idokhandira jeko rayene panyika ndokuunganidza mazambiringa yonyika, idoyakhanda pachisviniro chikuru choukari hwaMwari. <verse eid="REV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20" />Chisviniro chidotsikihwa kunze kwoguta, gazi ndokubirika pachisviniro richiyerera ridokwirira kusvika pamatomu yomabhiza ridoyerera kusvika pamazana matatu yomakhiromita.<verse eid="REV 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15" />
  <para style="s">Ngirozi dzinomwe dzoMatambudzo yokuPedzisira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1" />Zvino ndidoona chimwe chiratidzo kudenga, chikuru chinoshamisa, ngirozi dzinomwe nomatambudzo manomwe, yanga yari yokupedzisira, nokuti nomatambudziko yakareyo ukari hwaMwari hudopera.<verse eid="REV 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2" />Ndidoona changa chidoita kunge gungwa ridongwerevera ridosangana nomoto, naivo vadouya vakunda chirombo nomufananidzo wachene nochiverengo chozita rachene, vadomira padivi pogungwa ridongwerevera vanga vanomarimba yaMwari mumanja yavo. <verse eid="REV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3" />Vanga vachiimba chimbo chaMozisi, muranda waMwari, nochimbo choHwayana, vachiti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">“Mabasa yenyu makuru yanoshamisa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">Ishe Mwari womasimba yese!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">Nzira dzenyu nzochokwadi, uye dzidorurama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">Mambo womarudzi!<verse eid="REV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4" />Mbani asingakuchei nokukudza zita renyu, Ishe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">Nokuti imimi mega muri mutsvene.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Marudzi yese yachauya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">kudzokunamatai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">nokuti mabasa yenyu yadorurama yadoratidziwa.”<verse eid="REV 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5" />Mumasure mozvakarezvi ndidoona kudenga imba yaMwari inova dumba romutemo wochibvumirano, idozuruhwa, <verse eid="REV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6" />Muimba yaMwari mudobirika ngirozi dzinomwe dzinomadambudzo manomwe, dzidosimira mapiza yadochena futi yanoyetima, nozvipfuwa zvadzene zvanga zvidosungiwa nomicheka yondarama. <verse eid="REV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7" />Ipopo chimwe chozvisikwa zvipenyu zvinai chidopasa ngirozi dzinomwe mbiya dzinomwe dzondarama dzidozara ukari hwaMwari iye mupenyu nokusingaperepere. <verse eid="REV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8" />Imba yaMwari idozara noutsi hunobva pakubhwinya kwache nosimba rache, hapanai munhu adokona kupinda muimba yaMwari kusvikira matambudzo manomwe yongirozi dzinomwe yapera.<verse eid="REV 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16" />
  <para style="s">Mbiya dzoUkari hwaMwari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1" />Zvino ndidonzva izvi rinoruzha richibva muimba yaMwari richiti kungirozi dzinomwe, “Endai kodurura mbiya dzinomwe dzoukari hwaMwari panyika.”<verse eid="REV 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2" />Nokudaro ngirozi yokuthanga idoenda ndokudurura mbiya yayene panyika, zvironda zvidoipa zvinodzimba zvidouya pavanhu vanga vanochiratidzo chochirombo novainamata mufananidzo wachene.<verse eid="REV 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3" />Ngirozi yochipiri idodurura mbiya yayene mugungwa, ridosanduka rikaita kunge gazi romunhu adopfa, futi zvipenyu zvese zvanga zviri mugungwa zvidopfa.<verse eid="REV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4" />Ngirozi yochitatu idodurura mbiya yayene muhwizi nomutusipiti tomvura, mvura ndokusanduka kuva gazi. <verse eid="REV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5" />Ipopo ndidonzva ngirozi yomvura ichiti, “Imipa mudorurama Mutsvene, mumatongero yenyu yakareya, manga muripo uye muripo. <verse eid="REV 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6" />Ndava vadodeura gazi rovatsvene novaporofiti, uye mudovapasa gazi kuti vamwe. Ndiwo mubairo wavo!” <verse eid="REV 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7" />Ndidonzva atari ichiti, “Ehe, Ishe Mwari woMasimba yese, kutonga kwenyu ndokwochokwadi kudorurama!”<verse eid="REV 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8" />Ngirozi yochinai idodurura mbiya yayene pamusoro pozuva, zuva ndokupasiwa mvumo yokutsvonda vanhu nomoto. <verse eid="REV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9" />Vanhu vadotsvondewa nokutsvondewa kunochisa, vadobva vatukana zita raMwari anomasimba pamusoro pomatambudziko yakareya, havanai kupinduka nokumurumbidza.<verse eid="REV 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10" />Ngirozi yochishano idodurura mbiya yayene pamusoro pomupando woushe hwochirombo, noumambo hwachene hudova murima, vanhu vadotsenga zvirimi zvavo nokudzimbiwa, <verse eid="REV 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11" />uye vadotukana Mwari wokudenga pamusoro pokuhwadziwa nozvironda zvavo, havanai kupinduka kubva pamabasa yavo.<verse eid="REV 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12" />Ngirozi yochitanhatu idodurura mbiya yayene pamusoro pohwizi rikuru rinonzi Yufuretisi, mvura yarene idobva yapwa, kugadzirira nzira madzimambo yokumabvazuva. <verse eid="REV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13" />Ipopo ndidoona mweya youtsambwa mitatu inenge mazura ichibirika mumuromo wotsato nomumuromo wochirombo nomumuromo womuporofiti womabhwodo. <verse eid="REV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14" />Ndava ndiyo mweya yomashave, inoita zviratidzo inoenda kumadzimambo yonyika yese, kuvaunganidzira hondo pazuva rikuru raMwari Womasimba yese.<verse eid="REV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15" />“Ndiri kuuya kunge mbavha! Adokomborehwa anoramba adopenya achichengeta hembe dzache, kuti areke kudzotekaira ari pedzi achionehwa!”<verse eid="REV 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16" />Mashaveyo yadovaunganidza panzvimbo inonzi nochiHebheru Amagedhoni.<verse eid="REV 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17" />Ngirozi yochinomwe idodurura mbiya yayene mudenga, izvi rinoruzha ridobirika muimba yaMwari, richibva pamupando woushe, richiti, “Zvapera!” <verse eid="REV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18" />Pakarepo padova nokupenya kwokambarivari, nomazvi nokudhirima, nokugwetedzeka kukuru kwonyika kwanga kusinati kwaitika kubva padosikiwa vanhu, kwanga kudokuritsa kugwetedzeka kwakareko. <verse eid="REV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19" />Guta rikuru ridokamuriwa ndokuita zvikamu zvitatu, uye maguta yomarudzi yadokoromoka, ipopo Mwari adoyeuka guta rikuru roBhabhironi kuti ripasiwe mukombe woukari hwache. <verse eid="REV 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20" />Zvitsuwa zvese zvidotiza, nomakomo hayanai kuwanika. <verse eid="REV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21" />Chimvuramabhwe chikuru, chidobva kudenga ndokuwira pamusoro povanhu, kurema koribhwe rimwe norimwe kwanga kudoita kunge makhirogiramu makumi mashano, kusvikira vanhu vatukana Mwari nokuda kodambudziko rochimvuramabwe, nokuti ranga richichisa dambudziko rakarero.<verse eid="REV 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17" />
  <para style="s">Hure rinoMbiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1" />Ipopo imwe yongirozi dzinomwe dzanga dzinombiya dzinomwe idouya kwandiri ichiti, “Uya ndikunangidze kutongewa kwohure rikuru rinogara pamusoro pomvura izinji, <verse eid="REV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2" />madzimambo yonyika yadoita upombwe naro, novanogara panyika vadokorewa nowaini youhure hwarene.”<verse eid="REV 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3" />Ipopo adondiendesa kusango ndiri muMweya, ndidoona mukadzi adogadha chirombo chitsvuku changa chidozara nomazita yokushora Mwari, changa chinomisoro minomwe nomanyanga gumi. <verse eid="REV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4" />Mukadzi wanga adosimira hembe itsvuku noishava, adoshonga ndarama nozvinokosha nochuma, wanga adobata mujanja rache komichi yondarama yanga idozara nozvinonyangadza notsambwa youhure hwache, <verse eid="REV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5" />Pahuma yache panga padonyorewa zita ridosvisvika rokuti, “Bhabhironi guta rikuru, amai vomahure novozvinonyangadza zvonyika.” <verse eid="REV 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6" />Ipopo ndidoona mukadzi adokorewa nogazi rovatsvene uye nogazi ropfakazi dzidobaiwa nokuda kwaJesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 17:6">Pandidomuona ndidoshamisika maninge. <verse eid="REV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7" />Asi ngirozi idoti kwandiri, “Washamisiwa neiko? Ndichakunyepa zvidosvisvika zvomukadzi wakareyu, nozvochirombo chinomutakura chomisoro minomwe nomanyanga gumi. <verse eid="REV 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8" />Chirombo chawaona changa chiripo, uye hachichipo futi chaakukwira kubva mugomba risingagon'e kuti chiende koparadziwa, vanogara panyika vasinai kunyorewa mazita yavo mubhuku roupenyu kubva pamavambo yonyika, vachashamisika vachiona kuti chirombo changa chiripo hachichipo uye chichadzouya.<verse eid="REV 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9" />Zvakarezvi zvinoda pfungwa dzinouchenjeri. Misoro minomwe ndiyo makomo manomwe, padogara mukadzi, <verse eid="REV 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10" />ndiyowo madzimambo manomwe, vashano vadowa, mubodzi aripo, umwe anati wauya, kana wauya anofanira kugara kwokanguwa kapfupipfupi. <verse eid="REV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11" />Chirombo changa chiripo, hachichipo, ndiye wochisere asi ari mukati movanomwe, anoenda koparadziwa.<verse eid="REV 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12" />Manyanga gumi yawaona ndiyo madzimambo gumi yasati yapasiwa ushe, asi vachapasiwa simba semadzimambo pabodzi nochirombo panguwa ibodzi. <verse eid="REV 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13" />Vakareva vanomufungo mubodzi vanopasa simba ravo noushe hwavo kuchirombo. <verse eid="REV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14" />Vachahwisana noHwayana, Hwayana richavakunda, nokuti iro ndiShe womadzishe namambo womadzimambo, naivo vanoHwayana vadodaidziwa, vadosaruhwa futi vadotendeka.”<verse eid="REV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15" />Zvino adoti kwandiri, “Mvura idowanda yawaona, panogara hure, ndivo vanhu, nogurusvusvu, nonyika dzopasi pese, nomitauro. <verse eid="REV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16" />Manyanga gumi yawaona, iyoya pabodzi nochirombo zvichatsvatsvana nohure. Vacharisunhura nokuribaya, nokuja nyama yarene nokuripisa nomoto, <verse eid="REV 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17" />nokuti Mwari adoisa mumwoyo yavo kuti vaite chinangwa chache, chokuti vave nopfungwa ibodzi. Kuti vapase ushe hwavo nosimba ravo kuchirombo, kusvikira mashoko yaMwari yazazisiwa.<verse eid="REV 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18" />Mukadzi wawaona ndiro guta rikuru rinobata ushe pamusoro pomadzimambo yopanyika.”<verse eid="REV 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18" />
  <para style="s">Kuwa kwoBhabhironi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1" />Mumasure mozvakarezvi ndidoona imwe ngirozi ichiuya kubva kudenga. Yanga inomasimba makuru, uye nyika idovhenekehwa nokubhwinya kwayene. <verse eid="REV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2" />Idodaidzira noizvi rinoruzha ichiti, “Rawa! Rawa Bhabhironi guta rikuru! Rava nzvimbo inogara mashave nomweya yese yotsambwa, inogahwa notushiri twese totsambwa tunosemesa. <verse eid="REV 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3" />Nokuti nyika dzese dzopasi dzidomwa waini yozvido zvidoipa zvokusaya kuzvibata kwarene. Madzimambo yopasi pese yadoita upombwe naro, novanotengesa vopasi pese vadopfuma nokusazvidzora kwarene.”<verse eid="REV 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4" />Pakarepo ndidonzva rimwe izvi ridobva kudenga richiti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:4">“Vanhu vangu, birikai mariri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">kuti mureke kuwadzana naro pazvitema zvarene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">kuti mureke kudzopasiwawo matambudziko yarene,<verse eid="REV 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5" />nokuti zvitema zvarene zvaita muhwi unosvika kudenga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:5">uye Mwari vayeuka kuipa kwarene.<verse eid="REV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6" />Muritsiidze zvaridokuitirai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">uye riitirei zvidopetewa kairi nokuda kwomabasa yarene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:6">ridirirei kairi mumudziyo wakareyo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">waridodira iro.<verse eid="REV 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7" />Paridozvikudza nokuzvifadza napo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">rihwadzisei nokurichemedza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">Nokuda kwokuti rinoti mumwoyo marene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">‘Ndiri mambokadzi ndinogara pamupando,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">handizi chirikadzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">ndinosvikaba pakudzorira.’<verse eid="REV 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8" />Saka matambudziko yarene yachasvika nozuva ribodzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">uhwere nokurira nonzara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:8">richapisiwa nomoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">nokuti Ishe Mwari anoritonga anomasimba.”<verse eid="REV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9" />Zvino madzimambo yonyika yadoita upombwe nokuzvifadza naro, vacharira nokuita maundu pamusoro parene pavanoona utsi hwokutsva kwarene. <verse eid="REV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10" />Vachamira kurefurefu, vachicha kudzimbiwa kwarene, vachiti, “Nhamu! Nhamu! Iwepa guta rikuru, iwepa guta ridosimba, Bhabhironi! Munguwa ibodzi kutongewa kwako kwasvika.”<verse eid="REV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11" />Novanotengesa vomunyika vanorira nokuita maundu pamusoro parene, nokuti hapachinai munhu anotenga zvinhu zvavo, <verse eid="REV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12" />zvinhu zvondarama, nozvosirivha, nozvomabhwe yanokosha, nochuma chinodhura, nomapiza yadonakitsa, nomashava, nomatsvuku, noyanotsvedemukira, nomatanda yese yanonuhwirira, nomidziyo yese yonyanga dzonzou, nomarudzi yese yomidziyo yomatanda yanodhura, ndarira, dare, nomabhwe machena, <verse eid="REV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13" />nozvidosiyanasiyana zvinorungisiwa zvokuja, notwiro, nozvinonushira, nomura, nozvizoro, nowaini, nomapfuta yomuorivhi, noupfu hudotsetsa hwogorosi, nogorosi, mombe nomahwai, nomabhiza nongoro, novaranda inova mweya yovanhu. <verse eid="REV 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14" />Vachati, “Muchero wanga uchidiwa nomweya wako wabiritsiwa kwauri, nozvinhu zvese zvidonaka nozvinoyetimayetima zvakuperera, zvichawanikaba pakamu!” <verse eid="REV 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15" />Vanotengesa zvinhu zvakarezvi, vanga vapfumisiwa naro, vachamira kurefurefu, vachicha kuhwadziwa kwarene, vachirira nokuita maundu, <verse eid="REV 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16" />Vachiti, “Nhamu, nhamu, kuguta rikuru ranga ridosimira biza ridonaka, ridotsvuka norishava, ranga ridosimira ndarama, nomabhwe yanokosha, nochuma chinodhura! <verse eid="REV 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17" />Nokuti nonguwa ibodzi upfumi hwakarehu hwese hwapamwara.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 18:17">Zvino vachairi vozvikepe vese novese vanofamba mumvura, novanofambisa tumwadiya, novanoita mishando mugungwa, vadomira kurefurefu, <verse eid="REV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18" />Pavadoona utsi hwokutsva kwarene, vadoshamisika ndokudaidzira vachiti, “Ndipi guta ridofanana noguta rakareri rikuru?” <verse eid="REV 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19" />Ipopo vadozvidira maivhu pamisoro yavo, pavaidaidzira nokuita maundu vachiti, “Nhamu, nhamu, kuguta rikuru paipfumira vese vanga vanozvikepe zvavo mugungwa kuburikidza noupfumi hwarene! Nokuti nonguwa ibodzi ridoparadziwa!”<verse eid="REV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20" />Fara pamusoro parene, iwe denga, naimipa vatsvene nonhumwa novaporofiti, nokuti Mwari adoritonga nomutongo waridokutongai nawo!<verse eid="REV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21" />Pakarepo imwe ngirozi inosimba idosumudza ribwe rikuru rinenge guyo ndokurikhandira mugungwa, ichiti, “Ndizvo zvichaitiwa Bhabhironi guta rikuru richaphomorehwa pasi nosimba, haridzowanika pakamu.” <verse eid="REV 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22" />Zvino kuungira kwovanoridza marimba, nomazvi yovanoimba novanoridza pito, novanoridza tsuri, havachadzonzvika pakare mauri, namasiri wobasa ripi noripi zvarene haachadzowanika mauri pakare, nokuunga kwoguyo hakuchanzvika mauri pakamu, <verse eid="REV 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23" />nochiedza chomwenje hachichadzovheneka mauri pakare, noizvi romukowasha kana romuroora hazvichanzvika mauri, nokuti vatengesi vako vanga vari vakuru vomunyika, marudzi yese yadofurihwa nouroi hwako!”<verse eid="REV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24" />Mukati marene mudowanika gazi rovaporofiti norovatsvene, norovese vadobaiwa panyika.<verse eid="REV 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1" />Mumasure mozvakarezvi ndidonzva izvi rinoruzha kudenga ridoita kunge rogurusvusvu, richidaidzira richiti, “Hareruya! Ruponiso nokubhwinya nosimba nzvaMwari wedu, <verse eid="REV 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2" />nokuti kutonga kwache ndokwochokwadi futi kudorurama! Adotonga hure rikuru ridoodza nyika nouhure hwarene. Mwari adotsiidza gazi rovaranda vache pajanja rarene.” <verse eid="REV 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3" />Ipopo vadohwiridza pakamu vachiti, “Hareruya! Utsi hwarene hunokwira kumusoro nokusingaperepere!” <verse eid="REV 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4" />Zvino vakuru makumi mairi novanai nozvisikwa zvipenyu zvinai vadowira pasi ndokunamata Mwari wanga adogarikika pamupando woushe vachiti, “Ameni. Hareruya!”<verse eid="REV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mutambo woMuchato woHwayana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5" />Zvino izvi ridodaidzira richibva pamupando woushe richiti, “Rumbidzai Mwari wedu, imipa varanda vache mese, imipa munomucha, vakuru novadiki.” <verse eid="REV 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6" />Pakarepo ndidonzva izvi rinenge rogurusvusvu ridofanana nokutinhira kwomvura izinji kunge kutinhira kunoruzha, richiti, “Hareruya! Nokuti Ishe Mwari wedu womasimba yese waakubata ushe. <verse eid="REV 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7" />Mbatifarei timukudze nokumupasa kubhwinya, nokuti muchato woHwayana wasvika, mwenga wayene wagadzirira. <verse eid="REV 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8" />Adopasiwa simba kuti asimire biza ridonaka, rinopenya uye ridochena” nokuti mucheka udonaka ndizvo zvidorurama zvovatsvene.<verse eid="REV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9" />Zvino ngirozi idoti kwandiri, “Nyora uti, vadokomborehwa vakarevo vadokokewa kuchirairo chomuchato woHwayana.” Adoti kwandiri, “Yakareya mazvi yochokwadi yaMwari.”<verse eid="REV 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10" />Ipopo ndidowira pasi pamberi potsoka dzache kuti ndimunamate, asi adoti kwandiri, “Reka kudaro! Ndiri muranda pabodzi naiwewe nohama dzako dzinobata kupfakaza kwaJesu. Namata Mwari.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 19:10">Nokuti kupfakaza kwaJesu ndiwo mweya wouporofiti.<verse eid="REV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mugadhi woBhiza richena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11" />Pakarepo ndidoona denga ridovhuriwa, ndokuona bhiza richena, wanga adorigadha waiitiwa Adotendeka noWochokwadi, anotonga nokuhwa zvidorurama. <verse eid="REV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12" />Maziso yache yanga yadoita kunge marimi yomoto, pamusoro wache panga panokorona dzizinji. Wanga anozita ridonyorewa ranga risingazikane noumwe munhu asi naiye basi. <verse eid="REV 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13" />Wanga adosimira jasi ridonyikiwa mugazi, anodaidziwa nozita rokuti Shoko raMwari. <verse eid="REV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14" />Hondo dzokudenga, dzanga dzidosimira biza richene ridonaka risinai tsambwa, dzidomutevera dzidogadha mabhiza machena. <verse eid="REV 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15" />Mumuromo mache mudobirika bakatwa ridopinza rokuhwisa naro marudzi, achayatonga notsvimbo yosimbi, achatsika pachisviniro choukari hwaMwari Womasimba yese. <verse eid="REV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16" />Pajasi rache nopachafu yache panga padonyorewa zita rinoti, Mambo womadzimambo naIshe womadzishe.<verse eid="REV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17" />Pakarepo ndidoona ngirozi idomira pazuva, idodaidzira noizvi rinoruzha ichiti, kutushiri twese twanga tuchiurukha mudenga ichiti, “Uyai muungane pachirairo chikuru chaMwari, <verse eid="REV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18" />uyai muje nyama yomadzimambo, noyovatungamiri vohondo, noyovakuru vanosimba, nonyama yomabhiza, noyovanoyagadha, nonyama yovanhu vese, vese vadosununguka novaranda, vese vanokosha novasingakoshe!”<verse eid="REV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19" />Pakarepo ndidoona chirombo nomadzimambo yonyika nomauto yavo vadoungana kuti vahwisane naiye wanga adogadha bhiza nokuhwisana nomauto yache. <verse eid="REV 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20" />Ipopo chirombo chidobatiwa, pabodzi nomuporofiti womabhwodo adoita zviratidzo pamberi pachene zvaadofurira nazvo vakarevo vanga vadotambira chidzvanga chochirombo novainamata mufananidzo wachene. Vairi vakareva vadokhandiwa vari vapenyu mugomba romoto unopfuta nosarufa. <verse eid="REV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21" />Vamwe vese vadobaiwa nobakatwa ridobirika mumuromo waiyeuye wanga adogadha bhiza, tushiri twese tudoguta nyama yavo.<verse eid="REV 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20" />
  <para style="s">Makore Chiuru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1" />Pakarepo ndidoona ngirozi ichiburuka kubva kudenga, idobata ngetani dzikuru nomakhiyi yogomba risingagon'e. <verse eid="REV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2" />Adobata tsato, nyoka yokare iye, jabhurosi kana kuti Sathani, ndokumusunga kwomakore yanosvika chiuru. <verse eid="REV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3" />Adomukhandira mugomba, risingagon'e ndokumuvharira nokumunamira makaremo, kuti areke kudzofurira marudzi kusvikira makore yanosvika chiuru yapera. Mumasure mozvakarezvo anofanira kusununguhwa kwokanguwa kapfupipfupi.<verse eid="REV 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4" />Pakarepo ndidoona mipando youshe, vanga vadoigarira mbaye vadopasiwa simba rokutonga. Ndidoona pakamu mweya yovaye vanga vadogwatiwa misoro nokuda kwokupfakazira Jesu noshoko raMwari. Vakareva ndivo vanga vasinai kunamata chirombo kana mufananidzo wachene, vasinai kuisiwa chidzvanga chochirombo pahuma dzavo nopamanja yavo. Vadorarama, ndokutonga naKhirisitu kwomakore yanosvika chiuru. <verse eid="REV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5" />Vamwe vese vadopfa havanai kumuka kusvikira makore yanosvika chiuru yapera. Kwakareku ndiko kumuka kwokuthanga. <verse eid="REV 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6" />Vadokomborehwa pakare mbatsvene vanomugove pakumuka kwokuthanga! Panovakareva ipfa yochipiri hainai simba, asi vachava vaphirisita vaMwari novaKirisitu, vachatonga naye kwomakore yanosvika chiuru.<verse eid="REV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukundiwa kwaSathani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7" />Pakarepo kana makore yanosvika chiuru yapera, Sathani achasuguduriwa mutorongo rache, <verse eid="REV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8" />achabirika achienda konyengedza marudzi yese yari kumativi manai yonyika, vanova Goge naMagoge, kuti avaunganidzire kuhwa, kuwanda kwavo kunenge jecha riri kumahombekombe yogungwa. <verse eid="REV 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9" />Vadotekaira pakufararira kwonyika ndokupoteredza misasa yovatsvene noguta rinodiwa, asi pakarepo moto udoburuka kubva kudenga ukavaparadza. <verse eid="REV 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10" />Zvino jabhurosi adovanyengedza adokhandiwa mudziva romoto unopfuta nosarufa manga muno chirombo nomuporofiti womabhwodo, vachahwadzisiwa masikati nousiku nokusingaperepere.<verse eid="REV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutonga kwoKupedzisira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11" />Ipopo ndidoona mupando woushe mukuru muchena naiye wanga adogara pamusoro pawene, nyika nodenga zvidotiza pamberi pache uye nzvimbo yazvene hainai kudzowanika. <verse eid="REV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12" />Zvino ndidoona vadopfa, vakuru novadiki, vadomira pamberi pomupando woushe. Mabhuku yadovhuriwa, norimwe bhuku ridovhuriwawo, rinova bhuku roupenyu. Vadopfa vadotongewa maererano nozvavadoita semanyorehwo yazvanga zvidoitiwa mumabhuku. <verse eid="REV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13" />Gungwa ridobiritsa vadopfa vanga vari mariri, noipfa noNzvimbo yovadopfa zvidobiritsa vadopfa vanga vari mazviri, vese vadotongewa nozvavanga vadoita. <verse eid="REV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14" />Ipopo ipfa noNzvimbo yomweya yovadopfa zvidokhandiwa mudziva romoto. Yakarei ndiyo ipfa yochipiri, ndiro dziva romoto. <verse eid="REV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15" />Zvino zita romunhu kana risinai kuwaniwa ridonyohwa mubhuku roupenyu, adokhandiwa mudziva romoto.<verse eid="REV 20:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21" />
  <para style="s">Denga Ritsva noNyika Itsva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1" />Pakarepo ndidoona denga ritsva nonyika itsva, nokuti denga rokuthanga nonyika yokuthanga zvanga zvapfuura, kana gungwa ranga risisipo. <verse eid="REV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2" />Ndidoona guta ritsvene, Jerusarema ritsva, richiburuka pasi kubva kudenga kuna Mwari, ridogadzirihwa kunge muroora adoshongedzehwa murume wache. <verse eid="REV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3" />Ipopo ndidonzva izvi rinoruzha ridobva pamupando woushe richiti, “Nangarai, ugaro hwaMwari huri pakati povanhu. Achagara navo, ivo vachava vanhu vache, Mwari pachake achava navo, wova Mwari wavo. <verse eid="REV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4" />Achapisika misodzi yese pamatama yavo, hapachinai ipfa kana kurira kana mhere kana kudzimbiwa nokuti zvinhu zvokare zvapfuura.”<verse eid="REV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5" />Iye wanga adogarikika pamupando woushe adoti, “Nangarai, ndinosandura zvinhu zvese kuti zvive zvitsva.” Adotiwo pakamu, “Nyora zvakarezvi, nokuti mashoko yakareya yangatendewe njochokwadi.” <verse eid="REV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6" />Adoti kwandiri, “Zvaitiwa! Ndini Arufa naOmega, wokuthanga nowokupedzisira. Anonyota ndichamupasa zvinobva pakasipiti komvura youpenyu pasinai mubhadharo. <verse eid="REV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7" />Anokunda achagara nhaka yozvinhu zvakarezvi. Futi ndichava Mwari wache, iye achava mwanakomana wangu. <verse eid="REV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8" />Asi kuno vanocha, novasingatende, novanyangadzi, nomhondi, nomhombo, novaroi, novanonamata zvimifananidzo, novese vanobhwodoka mubairo wavo uchava mudziva rinopfuta moto nosarufa, ndiyo ipfa yochipiri.”<verse eid="REV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusarema Ritsva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9" />Zvino imwe yongirozi dzinomwe dzanga dzinombiya dzinomwe dzidozara matambudziko manomwe yokupedzisira, idotaura kwandiri, ichiti, “Uya pano, ndichakunangidza muroora, mukadzi woHwayana.” <verse eid="REV 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10" />Ipopo muMweya adonditakura achindiisa kugomo rikuru, rirefurefu, ndokundinangidza guta ritsvene Jerusarema richiburuka pasi richibva kudenga kuna Mwari, <verse eid="REV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11" />rinokubhwinya kwaMwari. Chiedza charene changa chidoita kunge dombo rinokosha maninge, kunge dombo rojasipisi, ridongwerevera kunge mvura yomatarara. <verse eid="REV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12" />Ranga rinomadziro makurufuti marefurefu, nomisuwo gumi nomiiri, pamisuwo panga pano ngirozi gumi nodziiri, uye panga padonyorewa mazita gumi nomairi yomarudzi yovana vaIzirairi, <verse eid="REV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13" />kumabvazuva kwanga kuno misuwo mitatu, kumaodzanyemba misuwo mitatu, kuchamhembe misuwo mitatu, nokumadokero misuwo mitatu. <verse eid="REV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14" />Madziro yoguta yanga yanonheyo gumi nodziiri pamusoro padzene panga padonyorewa mazita yonhumwa dzoHwayana gumi nodziiri. <verse eid="REV 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15" />Uyo adonyaira nainini wanga anotsvimbo yondarama yokuyeresa guta nomisuwo yarene nomadziro yarene. <verse eid="REV 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16" />Guta ranga ridoenzana mativi yarene manai, kurepha nokuphanyuka zvanga zvidofanana, adoyera guta notsvimbo yache, rikasvika makhiromita zviuru zviiri nomazana mairi. Kurepha kwarene nokuphanyuka hwarene nokukwirira kwarene zvanga zvidoenzana. <verse eid="REV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17" />Adoyera pakare madziro yarene, yadoita mamita makumi matanhatu nomashano nochiyero chomunhu, chiri chiyero chongirozi. <verse eid="REV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18" />Madziro yanga yadovakhiwa nojasipa, guta ranga riri rondarama idonakitsa, idongwerevera kunge girazi. <verse eid="REV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19" />Nheyo dzomadziro yoguta dzanga dzidonamiwa nomabhwe yomarudzi yese yanokosha. Nheyo yokuthanga yanga iri yojasipa, yochipiri yanga iri yosafaya, yochitatu yanga iri yoageti, yochinai yanga iri yoemarodhi, <verse eid="REV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20" />yochishano yanga iri yoonikisi, yochitanhatu yanga iri yokaneriyeni, yochinomwe yanga iri yokiraisoriti, yochisere yanga iri yobheriyero, yochipfemba yanga iri yotopazi, yogumi yanga iri yokiraisopurase, yogumi noibodzi yanga iri yojasinzi, yogumi nodziiri yanga iri yoametisiti. <verse eid="REV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21" />Misuwo gumi nomiiri yanga iri zvuma zvinokosha gumi nozviiri, musuwo umwe noumwe wanga udogadziriwa nochuma chinokosha chibodzi, nzira yomuguta yanga iri yondarama, idonakitsa, idongwerevera kunge girazi.<verse eid="REV 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22" />Handinai kuona imba yaMwari muguta, nokuti imba yaMwari yomuguta ndiIshe Mwari Womasimba yese noHwayana. <verse eid="REV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23" />Guta ranga risinai basa nozuva kana mwedzi kuti zvirivhenekere, nokuti kubhwinya kwaMwari ndochiedza charene, noHwayana ndomwenje warene. <verse eid="REV 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24" />Marudzi yovanhu yachatekaira muchiedza charene, nomadzimambo yonyika yachauyisa kubhwinya kwavo mukati marene. <verse eid="REV 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25" />Uye misuwo yarene haivhariwe masikati nokuti kwakareko kunenge kusinai usiku. <verse eid="REV 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26" />Vachauyisa mukati marene kubhwinya nokukudziwa kwomarudzi. <verse eid="REV 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27" />Hapanai chinotsambwa chichapinda mukati marene, kana anodzonga kana anomabhwodo. Asi vakarevo chete chete vadonyorewa mubhuku roupenyu roHwayana.<verse eid="REV 21:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1" />Zvino ngirozi idondinangidza hwizi hwomvura youpenyu, iri ngwiro kunge matarara, yanga ichiyerera ichibva pamupando woushe hwaMwari nohwoHwayana, <verse eid="REV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2" />ichipinda nopakati ponzira yoguta. Kumativi mairi yohwizi kwanga kuno muti woupenyu wanga uchibereka michero yomarudzi gumi nomairi, pamwedzi umwe noumwe, pakamu mazani yawene yaiva yokuporesa marudzi. <verse eid="REV 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3" />Hakuchinai chinhu chidoshurikidziwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:3">Asi mupando waMwari woushe nowoHwayana uchava mukati marene, varanda vache vachamunamata. <verse eid="REV 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4" />Vachaona chiso chache, uye zita rache richava pahuma dzavo. <verse eid="REV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5" />Usiku hahuchadzovapo, havachadzoda chiedza chomwenje kana chozuva, nokuti Ishe Mwari achava chiedza chavo, uye vachatonga nokusingaperepere.<verse eid="REV 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuuya kwaJesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6" />Zvino ngirozi idoti kwandiri, “Mashoko yakareya yadotendeka njochokwadi. Ishe, Mwari womweya yovaporofiti, adotuma ngirozi yache kuti inangidze varanda vache zvinhu zvaakuda kuitiwa.”<verse eid="REV 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7" />“Onai, ndinouya kamangu. Adokomborehwa wakareyo anochengeta mashoko yochiporofiti chomubhuku rakareri.”<verse eid="REV 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8" />Inipano Johwani ndini ndidonzva nokuona zvinhu zvakarezvi. Zvino pandidonzva nokuzviona, ndidohwarara kuti ndinamate pamberi potsoka dzongirozi idondinangidza zvakarezvi. <verse eid="REV 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9" />Asi idoti kwandiri, “Reka kudaro! Ndiri muranda pabodzi naiwepa nohama dzako vaporofiti, novanochengeta mashoko yobhuku rakareri. Namata Mwari.” <verse eid="REV 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10" />Ipopo idoti kwandiri, “Reka kuzarira mashoko yochiporofiti yari mubhuku rakareri, nokuti nguwa yaapapfupi. <verse eid="REV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11" />Muiti wozvidoipa mbaarambe achiita zvidoipa, noanotsambwa mbaarambe achisvipisiwa, noadorurama mbaarambe achiita zvidorurama, nomutsvene mbaarambe ari mutsvene.”<verse eid="REV 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12" />“Onai, ndinouya kamangu, ndinouya nomubairo wangu kuti ndidzopasa umwe noumwe sezvaadobata. <verse eid="REV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13" />Ndini Arufa naOmega, wokuthanga nowokupedzisira, mavambo nomagumo.”<verse eid="REV 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14" />Vadokomborehwa vanosuka hembe dzavo, kuti vave nokodzero yokuuya kumuti woupenyu kuti vapinde muguta nopamisuwo. <verse eid="REV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15" />Panze ndipo panoimbwa novaroi nomhombo novaurayi novanonamata zvifananidzo, novese vanoda mabhwodo vachiyaita.<verse eid="REV 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16" />Inini Jesu ndidotuma ngirozi yangu kuti ikupfakazirei zvakarezvi kumakherekhe. Ndini mudzi nobukira rorudzi raDhavhiti, nyenyedzi inopenya yomambakwedza.”<verse eid="REV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17" />Mweya noMuroora vanoti, “Uya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:17">Naiye anonzva mbaati, “Uya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:17">Noanonyota mbaauye, anoda mbaatore mvura youpenyu pasinai chaanobhadhara.<verse eid="REV 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mashoko yokupedzisira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18" />Ndinoyambira umwe noumwe anonzva mashoko yochiporofiti yari mubhuku rakareri ndichiti, kana munhu akaingidzira pazvinhu zvakarezvi, Mwari vachaingidzira kwaari matambudzo yadonyorewa mubhuku rakareri. <verse eid="REV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19" />Kana munhu akatapudza mashoko yobhuku yokuporofita kwakareku, Mwari vachatapudza mugove wache pamuti woupenyu nomuguta ritsvene, nopazvinhu zvidonyohwa mubhuku rakareri.<verse eid="REV 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20" />Iye anopfakaza zvinhu zvakarezvi anoti, “Chokwadi ndinouya kamangu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:20">Ameni. Uyai Ishe Jesu!<verse eid="REV 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21" />Mutsa waIshe Jesu mbauve novanhu vese. Ameni.<verse eid="REV 22:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22" />
</usx>